### Login:
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "example@mail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Logout:
GET {{host}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json


### GET user-info:
GET {{host}}/auth/user-info
Content-Type: application/json

### findProducts:
GET {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

### createProduct:
POST {{host}}/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ibuprofen",
  "photo": "https://i.ibb.co/bLKP624/5-15-1000x1000-min.jpg",
  "supplierId": 24,
  "stock": 25,
  "price": 45.99,
  "category": "Medicine"
}

### updateProduct:
PATCH {{host}}/products/64
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bepanten"
}